  "title": "633d Air Base Wing, Hampton, and NASA Fire Departments extinguish a structural fire",
  "description": "Fire fighters with the 633d Civil Engineer Squadron, NASA Langley Fire and Rescue and Hampton Division of Fire and Rescue worked together to extinguish a structural fire at Joint Base Langley-Eustis, Virginia, Sept, 25, 2026. The coordinated response highlighted the strength of mutual aid partnerships, enabling military and civilian fire departments to share personnel, equipment and expertise to protect lives, safeguard infrastructure and strengthen emergency response capabilities across the installation and surrounding communities. (U.S. Air Force video by Senior Airman Olivia Bithell)",
